"The severity of punishments is not fixed. It shall vary with the Maid's "
"conduct: how faithfully the household's routines are kept, how many matters "
"remain outstanding, how often Madame's choice of attire has been declined, "
"and how much of the debt still stands. Madame does not disclose her methods. "
"She merely observes."
